#4011001
Azura's coast, Ahemmusa, ashlander camp~
Open grasslands spread between hide yurts weathered by sun, winds and dry air,
with narrow footpaths crossing bare patches of soil marked by countless steps.
Smoke from low fires drifts above reed baskets, clay urns and bundled supplies
as wild grasses rustle around the scattered tribal shelters.~
