#HELPS
1 AHEMMUSA CAMP~
Ahemmusa Camp is a quiet Ashlander settlement north of the coastal town of Vos
where hide yurts stand amid game paths, grazing guar and windswept grasslands.
The tribal healer, wise woman and elders gather around the camp's open center,
and herders range across the broad territory claimed by the tribe.~
